Glide apes are a cross between a monkey and a flying squirrel: apes with flaps of skin in their arms that they use to glide from tree to tree. A pack of them lives in the canopy of the [[Verdant Expanse]] near where it is entered from [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]].
